<title>USA: U.S. can't confirm Iraqi attack on U.S. planes.</title>
<headline>U.S. can't confirm Iraqi attack on U.S. planes.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The United States said on Saturday it could not confirm that Iraq had fired surface-to-air missiles against U.S. warplanes policing no-fly zones in northern and southern Iraq.</p>
<p>&quot;At this time we have no information to confirm that,&quot; said a White House spokesman, Barry Toiv. He said U.S. officials were checking out the report.</p>
